## 🆘 Troubleshooting

### Invoice doesn't appear after preview
- Make sure all required fields are filled
- Check that you've added at least one item
- Refresh the page and try again

### PDF download fails
- Try using a different browser
- Check if pop-ups are blocked
- Clear browser cache and try again

### Date shows incorrectly
- Verify your browser's date/time settings
- Try selecting the date again

### Mobile buttons don't work
- Make sure you're not zoomed in too much
- Try rotating your phone to landscape view
- Clear browser cache

## 📞 Support
For issues or questions, check your browser's console (F12) for any error messages.

